# MPT OmniPortal V2 needs NO environment variables.
#
# The app is a static site: the sales CSV is read and processed entirely in the
# browser, so there is no backend URL, no API key and no secret to configure.
# Leave this empty when deploying (e.g. on Vercel).
#
# Historical note: V1 used NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL to reach a Python FastAPI
# server. That server is no longer used by the web app.
